{"id":21037,"path":"/listening/a2/what-were-you-doing-at-the-time-of-the-murder-past-tenses-a2-english-listening-test/","parentId":1140,"order":850,"section":"listening","level":"a2","depth":3,"title":"What were you doing at the time of the murder? – A2 English Listening","seo":{"title":"What were you doing at the time of the murder? – A2 English Listening - Test-English","description":"Listening comprehension test for beginners and elementary students (CEFR A2 level). What were you doing...? (Past tenses)","image":"/media/uploads/A2%E2%80%93English-Listening-Test_What-were-you-doing_Psat-tenses.jpg"},"modified":"2026-09-25T12:17:02","kind":"lesson","parts":["<h3>A2 English Listening Test</h3> <h5>Listen to a police officer interviewing Lucille Carrington about her husband’s death. For questions 1 to 8 choose the correct answer.</h5> <div class=\"videoWrapper\"> <div data-youtube=\"WkpHFzegBg8\"></div> </div> <h6>See the full list of <a href=\"/listening/a2/\">A2 listening tests</a></h6> <div class=\"list-separator-dots\"><span>Questions</span></div> <div data-quiz=\"766\"></div>"],"explanation":null,"quizzes":[{"id":766,"questions":[{"id":6496,"num":"1","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Someone killed James Carrington with ____.</div>","choices":[{"id":11277,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>a gun</span>"},{"id":11278,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>a knife</span>"},{"id":11279,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>poison</span>"}]},{"id":6497,"num":"2","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Lucille was staying with her ____ Joanna at the time of his death. </div>","choices":[{"id":11280,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>friend</span>"},{"id":11281,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>aunt</span>"},{"id":11282,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>daughter</span>"}]},{"id":6498,"num":"3","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>On the afternoon of the 5th June, Lucille was buying ____.</div>","choices":[{"id":11283,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>tea</span>"},{"id":11284,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>medicine</span>"},{"id":11285,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>clothes</span>"}]},{"id":6499,"num":"4","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>She spent that afternoon ___.</div>","choices":[{"id":11286,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>with Joanna</span>"},{"id":11287,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>with James</span>"},{"id":11288,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>alone</span>"}]},{"id":6500,"num":"5","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>The neighbour, Mrs Box, saw a woman wearing a _____.</div>","choices":[{"id":11289,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>grey hat</span>"},{"id":11290,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>coat</span>"},{"id":11291,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>long dress</span>"}]},{"id":6501,"num":"6","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>According to Mrs Box, a man and a woman were ____ in the house.</div>","choices":[{"id":11292,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>talking</span>"},{"id":11293,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>fighting</span>"},{"id":11294,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>arguing</span>"}]},{"id":6503,"num":"7","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Lucille ____.</div>","choices":[{"id":11298,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>knew who James' lover was</span>"},{"id":11299,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>had seen James with his lover once</span>"},{"id":11300,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>didn't know who James' lover was</span>"}]},{"id":6502,"num":"8","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>Lucille thinks that James' lover killed him ____.</div>","choices":[{"id":11295,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>for money</span>"},{"id":11296,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>because she found something in his pocket</span>"},{"id":11297,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>because she was jealous </span>"}]}]}]}